			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Cinematic shot in the style of King Hu, wuxia movie aesthetics, 1970s film grain. A solitary female swordswoman wearing a black hanfu robe and a bamboo conical hat with white ribbons, standing on a barren, rocky volcanic mountain. Thick, ethereal white mist swirling around the landscape. Low saturation, earth tones, cyan and grey color palette. Traditional Chinese painting composition, atmospheric depth. The wind gently blows her ribbons and robes. Intense, stoic expression. Wide angle lens, mystical atmosphere. --ar 21:9"
