			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Cinematic slow dolly out. A solitary female Wuxia swordswoman in a bamboo hat stands stoically and perfectly still on a jagged cliff. Fierce wind vigorously blows her long white veil and black robes, creating intense dynamic movement against her rigid pose. Dense, volumetric fog and clouds rush and billow rapidly through the deep, dark mountain gorge. Classic King Hu (胡金铨) \"A Touch of Zen\" film aesthetics. Desaturated cool cyan-grey color palette, vintage 35mm film grain. Epic Chinese ink-wash landscape composition. Solitary, highly tense, and deeply atmospheric."
